   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "seit, vor and nach",
     "texto": [
      "**Seit** means \"for\" (since) and is used with the present: **Ich wohne seit zwei Jahren hier** (I've lived here for two years).",
      "**Vor** means \"ago\" in the past: **vor einer Woche** (a week ago). **Nach** means \"after\": **nach dem Fest** (after the party). All three take the **dative**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "bei, ab and bis",
     "texto": [
      "**Bei** means \"at the time of\": **bei der Feier** (at the celebration). **Ab** means \"from\": **ab Freitag** (from Friday). **Bis** means \"until\" and with days it takes no article: **bis Freitag** (until Friday).",
      "Watch out for the false friend: **bei** doesn't mean \"by\", but \"at someone's house\" or \"at the time of\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
